    "https://www.careers.gov.sg/": {
      "title": "Make a difference for tomorrow",
      "description": "Home | Careers@Gov Skip to main content A Singapore Government Agency Website How to identify Official website links end with .gov.sg Government agencies communicate via .gov.sg websites (e.g. go.gov.sg/open). Trusted websites (opens in new tab) Secure websites use HTTPS Look for a lock ( ) or https:// as an added precaution. Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites. Government officials will never ask you for money or your bank log-in details over the phone. If you receive such a call, hang up and call ScamShield at 1799. Who we are What we do Join us Apply now ↗ (opens in new tab) FAQs ↗ (opens in new tab) Make a difference for tomorrow Discover a career in the Singapore Public Service that is as rewarding as it is purposeful. Apply for jobs now (opens in new tab) Shape Singapore's future and yours with us A meaningful career Your work helps to build a better tomorrow. Join a team that tackles current and future challenges on a national scale. Diverse career options Realise your aspirations with a diverse range of roles across 16 Ministries and more than 50 statutory boards. Commitment to your growth We invest in our people. Grow as a professional with our diverse training, job rotation and attachment opportunities. Care for your well-being Balance your work-life priorities with our flexible work arrangements and employee wellness programmes. What to expect One purpose, many possibilities Work in a place where your passion aligns with your career. See what we do Read about us on CHALLENGE Curious about what working in the Public Service is like? Let CHALLENGE be your guide! Read our latest stories (opens in new tab) Careers@Gov Who we are What we do Join us Apply now (opens in new tab) FAQs (opens in new tab) Reach us Contact Feedback (opens in new tab) © 2026 Government of Singapore , last updated 1 September 2026 Report Vulnerability (opens in new tab) Privacy Statement Terms of Use REACH (opens in new tab) Made with Isomer (opens in new tab) Built by Open Government Products (opens in new tab) Careers@Gov Who we are What we do Join us Apply now (opens in new tab) FAQs (opens in new tab) Reach us Contact Feedback (opens in new tab) © 2026 Government of Singapore , last updated 1 September 2026 Report Vulnerability (opens in new tab) Privacy Statement Terms of Use REACH (opens in new tab) Made with Isomer (opens in new tab) Built by Open Government Products (opens in new tab)"
