    "https://www.careers.gov.sg/contact-us/": {
      "title": "Contact us",
      "description": "Contact us | Careers@Gov Skip to main content A Singapore Government Agency Website How to identify Official website links end with .gov.sg Government agencies communicate via .gov.sg websites (e.g. go.gov.sg/open). Trusted websites (opens in new tab) Secure websites use HTTPS Look for a lock ( ) or https:// as an added precaution. Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites. Government officials will never ask you for money or your bank log-in details over the phone. If you receive such a call, hang up and call ScamShield at 1799. Who we are What we do Join us Apply now ↗ (opens in new tab) FAQs ↗ (opens in new tab) Home Contact us Contact us Get in touch with the Careers@Gov team. Last updated 13 August 2026 On this page FAQs Technical support Non-technical queries and feedback Mailing address FAQs If you have a query, please check our Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) page at https://ask.gov.sg/careersatgov ↗ (opens in new tab) and you may find your answer there. Technical support If you require technical support or wish to report a problem related to the functionality of the Careers@Gov website, please email careers.gov.technicalhelp@psd.gov.sg ↗ (opens in new tab) . Non-technical queries and feedback If you have a non-technical query that is not addressed in our FAQs, or feedback regarding information provided on Careers@Gov, please fill in our online form ↗ (opens in new tab) . Mailing address Public Service Division 100 High Street #07-00 The Treasury Singapore 179434 Back to top Careers@Gov Who we are What we do Join us Apply now (opens in new tab) FAQs (opens in new tab) Reach us Contact Feedback (opens in new tab) © 2026 Government of Singapore , last updated 1 September 2026 Report Vulnerability (opens in new tab) Privacy Statement Terms of Use REACH (opens in new tab) Made with Isomer (opens in new tab) Built by Open Government Products (opens in new tab) Careers@Gov Who we are What we do Join us Apply now (opens in